  "text": "Beneath the lamps’ ethereal, pale light,\nHe walked the streets in dead of night.\nEach step echoed on stone and street,\nWhere urban shadows softly meet.\n\nLike ghosts, the people drifted by,\nWith vacant eyes and averted eye.\nTheir faces buried deep within\nA world of their own, cold and thin.\n\nAmidst the sea of concrete tide,\nHe felt the weight of solitude.\n\nThe animal known for its long neck is the giraffe."
